        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERDRIVE is a fast paced space combat action game that combines the elements of roguelikes, infinite runners, and classic sci-fi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is recovering from its first intergalactic war, the War for Sol decimated the resources of all factions, and left the Federation crippled despite its victory. This created the ideal conditions for independents and opportunistic businesses to rise up and fill in the gaps in the supply chain....albeit not always legally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your HYPERDRIVE engine to traverse the hyperspace lanes to make deliveries<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successes in your endeavors will reward you with new ship types<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy or avoid obstacles increase your score with either method<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid Federation detection, and if it comes to it, destroy enemy combatants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don't make too much trouble, or the Federation might start taking you seriously  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HYPERDRIVE is a fast paced space combat action game that combines the elements of roguelikes, infinite runners, and classic sci-fi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is recovering from its first intergalactic war, the War for Sol decimated the resources of all factions, and left the Federation crippled despite its victory. This created the ideal conditions for independents and opportunistic businesses to rise up and fill in the gaps in the supply chain....albeit not always legally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of your HYPERDRIVE engine to traverse the hyperspace lanes to make deliveries<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/e87425421d3f06ddf5045a8513075aa9.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successes in your endeavors will reward you with new ship types<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/863501d60dbe641ee1106d5cf2044295.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy or avoid obstacles increase your score with either method<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/14736de66323d5d216d8da5b02eef0e2.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid Federation detection, and if it comes to it, destroy enemy combatants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/fab064cf7625b619e4daf668449ef177.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don't make too much trouble, or the Federation might start taking you seriously  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.poster.avif?t=1759161929\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.webm?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678450/extras/0fc82d3d84f93a4935a929e0b06628b1.mp4?t=1759161929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
